Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.00,0:00:06.00,staff,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\fs60}翻譯：掛件 kurako sigterm  時軸：澄空秋色  校對：小恐龍 小孝  壓製：James
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.97,0:01:12.76,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Hey 調子どうだい?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.20,0:01:14.68,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}どうだって晴れだい
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.04,0:01:17.36,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}頑張っても 頑張んなくても
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.45,0:01:21.27,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Hey どんな壁だって
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.27,0:01:23.19,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}目の前にあれど
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.19,0:01:27.40,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}気づかない だって壁じゃない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.40,0:01:35.61,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}どんな寂しさも 全部受け止めるからね
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.61,0:01:37.71,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Wake Up!） ちょっと遊んだり
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.71,0:01:39.96,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Hey World!） ちょっと悩んだり
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.96,0:01:42.00,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}ないものばっか数えないで
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.00,0:01:43.84,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}手んなかそっと数えたら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.84,0:01:45.88,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Get One!） ほらね聞こえる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.88,0:01:48.01,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Get One!） ほらね感じる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.01,0:01:51.95,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Take One!） 君に伝えたくて ここにいるから
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.47,0:01:54.26,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}We can do!! で You can ドゥ!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.26,0:01:56.64,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}世界ごと Love & peace
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.64,0:01:58.88,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}あれもこれもそれもどれも
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.88,0:02:00.82,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}半分こ （にしよう）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.82,0:02:04.98,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}あらゆる世界が私たち変えても
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:07.24,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}嬉しい楽しい美味しいだけは
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.24,0:02:09.74,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}忘れないでーね!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.05,0:02:12.20,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Hey world?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.08,0:02:14.20,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Say yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.12,0:02:16.25,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Good world!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.97,0:01:12.76,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Hey 心情怎麼樣?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.20,0:01:14.68,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}像晴天一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.04,0:01:17.36,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}努力也好 不努力也好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.45,0:01:21.27,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Hey 無論什麼牆壁
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.27,0:01:23.19,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}在我的眼前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.19,0:01:27.40,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}也不在意它 也不會阻擋我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.40,0:01:35.61,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}無論怎樣寂寞 全部欣然接受
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.61,0:01:37.71,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Wake Up!） 再玩一小會
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.71,0:01:39.96,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Hey World!） 稍有些煩惱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.96,0:01:42.00,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}沒有的東西不要去數了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.00,0:01:43.84,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}只要數清手中的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.84,0:01:45.88,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Get One!） 就能聽得見
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.88,0:01:48.01,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Get One!） 就會感受到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.01,0:01:51.95,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Take One!） 我就在這裡 想要對你說
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.47,0:01:54.26,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}我們能做到!! 豆能做到!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.26,0:01:56.64,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}帶給每個世界 Love & peace
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.64,0:01:58.88,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}這裡 那裡 這裡 那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.88,0:02:00.82,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}一半（分給你）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.82,0:02:04.98,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}就算讓世界 改變了我們
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:07.24,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}只有開心 歡樂和美味
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.24,0:02:09.74,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}請不要忘記!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.05,0:02:12.20,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Hey world?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.08,0:02:14.20,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Say yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.12,0:02:16.25,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Good world!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.78,0:21:01.91,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}娘のドゥが
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.53,0:21:03.96,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}優しすぎる~!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.19,0:21:13.23,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}はいはい!　そろそろ　危機感!?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.47,0:21:16.92,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}予測をつかない思考回路
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.20,0:21:19.48,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}はいはい!　たびたび　虚無感!!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.48,0:21:22.97,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}私の手に負えない
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.41,0:21:25.83,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}なんてこと…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.83,0:21:28.98,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}このところ魔界は平和です
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.37,0:21:31.80,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}だけどちょっと
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.80,0:21:33.71,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}こんなのもいいのかなぁ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.71,0:21:34.86,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}にこにこにこ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.86,0:21:36.15,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}いっせーの
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.15,0:21:38.42,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}いっこ　にこ　さんこ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.42,0:21:39.15,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}なんだい?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.15,0:21:41.42,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}分けてあげるよ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.42,0:21:42.12,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}うんうん
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.12,0:21:45.37,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}みんな一緒でにこにこ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.37,0:21:47.58,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}みんな一緒で　みんなにこにこ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.58,0:21:48.54,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}はいはい
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.54,0:21:50.64,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}みんな一緒で　みんなにこにこ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.64,0:21:51.55,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}はいはい
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.55,0:21:53.54,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}みんな一緒で　みんなにこにこ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.54,0:21:56.17,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}ちょいまちー!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.17,0:21:58.86,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}こんなんじゃダメダメダメダメだ
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.86,0:22:00.72,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}流されちゃいそうだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.72,0:22:03.72,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}忙しいの　私
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.72,0:22:06.31,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}世·界·侵·略!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.31,0:22:09.35,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}こんなはずじゃないのに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.35,0:22:10.84,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}ダメダメダメダメだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.84,0:22:12.66,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}流されちゃダメだ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.66,0:22:15.73,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}次から次ToDo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.73,0:22:18.15,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}お·め·め　うるうる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.15,0:22:21.15,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}にこにこしちゃいそう
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.78,0:22:24.42,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}にっ!　にこにこ!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.78,0:21:01.91,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我的女兒豆豆
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.53,0:21:03.96,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}太溫柔了~!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.19,0:21:13.23,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}好啦好啦! 快快 危機感!?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.47,0:21:16.92,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}無法預測的思考迴路
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.20,0:21:19.48,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}好啦好啦! 偶爾 虛無感!!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.48,0:21:22.97,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我兩手都忙不過來啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.41,0:21:25.83,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}怎麼會這樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.83,0:21:28.98,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}最近的魔界真和平
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.37,0:21:31.80,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不過有點覺得
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.80,0:21:33.71,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}也許這樣也不錯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.71,0:21:34.86,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}微笑微笑微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.86,0:21:36.15,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}一二三
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.15,0:21:38.42,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}1個 2個 3個
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.42,0:21:39.15,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}怎麼了?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.15,0:21:41.42,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}排排坐 分果果
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.42,0:21:42.12,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.12,0:21:45.37,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}大家一起微笑微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.37,0:21:47.58,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}大家一起 一起微笑微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.58,0:21:48.54,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}好好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.54,0:21:50.64,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}大家一起 一起微笑微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.64,0:21:51.55,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}好好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.55,0:21:53.54,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}大家一起 一起微笑微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.54,0:21:56.17,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}給我等等—!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.17,0:21:58.86,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}這樣可不行不行不行不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.86,0:22:00.72,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}要被帶偏了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.72,0:22:03.72,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}忙活的可是我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.72,0:22:06.31,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}侵·略·世·界!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.31,0:22:09.35,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}本來不是該是這樣的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.35,0:22:10.84,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不行不行不行不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.84,0:22:12.66,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不能被帶偏了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.66,0:22:15.73,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}接連不斷的ToDo
